PASS -- the dz = 0 source-cell average is now available in closed
form, with no reach parameter to converge and no box to enlarge.
Together with the sinc form factor at dz != 0, the cell average
is exact at every separation, and the O(1/R) shape-dependent
shell sum is no longer on the critical path.

⚠ SCOPE: k_par = 0 and one frequency.  The tail is exact through
d^2; its residual is the cube's non-isotropic fourth moment, which
R0 controls.  Wiring this into build_slab_kernels is NOT done here.
